{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an egg. \u00a0You, <i>oh no</i>, you were happy in your nest, <i>but you just got blown out</i> in a storm. \u00a0Can you find your way back up? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong>: just roll and jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single rainy world:</strong>\u00a0explore one continuous landscape as you find your way back.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D physics-based movement</strong>:\u00a0Roll,  jump, and slide around just like a real egg!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm, rainy atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0No enemies, no timers; you can take your time and soak up the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and sweet:</strong>\u00a0about three hours playtime for a new player (though it might take longer if you get stuck...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging moments</strong>: the game balances gentle bopping about with more challenging segments. \u00a0Be prepared to sweat as you line up that final jump before the next checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: chill for the most part : )</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831080?t=1761420449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831080/0a8fb0e6514674bf0f1e93d7680065312f18c1a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761420449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831080/540999aafc3302400b0b95d6ae3c70745e1b7c56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761420449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831080/540999aafc3302400b0b95d6ae3c70745e1b7c56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761420449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descriptio